    description: "Split from WI-kosar-sanoz-gojif-foruv-pupul-kusil-kavot-zidut on 2026-10-17 (PR #1702 fixed the five known members and gave each its own fixture). The general guard the item asked for is a parametrised harness over every registered analyzer with a minimal per-language two-file snippet (file A: callable F calling helperA; file B: callable F calling helperB) asserting that every calls/references edge whose src is F has src.path == dst.path. Needs ~60 language snippets; analyzers that fail it on first run are new members of the family and get their own INV. The regex-on-variable-name gate was evaluated and rejected (11 of 13 hits are legitimate callee lookups), so this harness is the enforced shape."  # dca0
